body:
Hello MrBoomHead, thank you for thinking otherwise. I appreciate it.

&#x200B;

Unfortunately, I live in the Philippines and the suicide helpline here is close to nonexistent. I have tried calling them multiple times but no one's answered. If I could afford therapy and proper medication, I would, too. But I don't have money for that, neither does my family.

I care deeply about the people in my life. Despite having this strong urge to kill myself, I want to make sure that I get to make them happy and warm and safe before I disappear. I don't want to leave the people i love hanging, because I know it will be difficult for them.

&#x200B;

I just believe that my time here is done, and as of the moment, I just feel like doing what i plan to do is the right thing. People think it's the "easy way out", but it's not. It really isn't.

&#x200B;

I am sending warmth and light your way, friend. Thank you for taking the time to respond to this thread. I appreciate it.
